        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Lawn Mower Pro + Leaf Blower bundle covers your yard across two seasons with one platform. Two modules, one Core, swapped in minutes as the seasons change.</p><p>From spring through fall, the Lawn Mower Pro Module keeps your lawn cut on a fully automated schedule. When the leaves drop, swap to the Leaf Blower Module and let Yarbo clear them across your entire property.</p><p>Both modules run on the same Yarbo Core, navigating with RTK GPS and stereo vision across slopes up to 70% (35°) grade. No boundary wires, no manual intervention.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Lawn Mower Pro + Leaf Blower bundle gives you autonomous yard care across two seasons in a single purchase. The Lawn Mower Pro Module handles your grass from spring through fall. The Leaf Blower Module takes over when the leaves come down. One Yarbo Core powers both.</p><p>Coverage up to 6.2 acres for the mower, with dual 300W motors and 2,500W peak power. High velocity airflow for the blower. RTK GPS and stereo vision navigation across both modules, no boundary wires required.</p><p>Swap modules in minutes, tool-free. Yarbo does the rest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Yarbo's standard 2-year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, for the Core and both included modules, from the date your machine is activated. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Setup requires no professional installation and no buried boundary wires.</p><ol><li>Charge the Yarbo Core battery fully before first use.</li><li>Attach the Lawn Mower Pro Module by aligning and locking it onto the Core.</li><li>Download the Yarbo app and follow the in-app mapping process to define your mowing zones.</li><li>Set your schedule. Yarbo returns to dock automatically when complete or when battery is low.</li></ol><p>To switch to the Leaf Blower Module, detach the mower module and attach the blower module in under 2 minutes. Remap or adjust your zone settings in the app as needed for leaf clearing routes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Yarbo Core: RTK-GPS, stereo vision, ODOM navigation. Slopes up to 70% grade (35 degrees). Tracked all-terrain base. Wi-Fi, app control, physical controller compatible.</p><p>Lawn Mower Pro Module: Dual 300W motors. 2,500W peak power. Coverage up to 6.2 acres. Cutting height 0.8 to 4.0 inches, 20 adjustable settings. Reinforced dual discs or mulching blades.</p><p>Leaf Blower Module: High velocity airflow clears leaves and debris automatically across your property.</p><p>Bundle includes: Yarbo Core, Data Center &amp; Docking Station, Yarbo Battery, Lawn Mower Pro Module, Leaf Blower Module.</p>"
          }
        },
